<title>JAPAN: Canon -1996 group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Canon -1996 group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.56 trln	 vs	    2.17 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  221.04		vs	  153.84</p>
<p> Current	    182.77		vs	  117.23</p>
<p> Net		   94.18		vs	   55.04</p>
<p> EPS		  106.96 yen	  vs	   62.73 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Canon Inc is a manufacturer of printers, copiers and computer peripherals. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
